<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico seeks to inject 2.335 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico seeks to inject 2.335 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Money market dealers said Wednesday that the Banco de Mexico sought to inject 2.335 billion pesos in the secondary market through two credit auctions.</p>
<p>It had assigned the first credit at the following rate by 1330 local time/1730 GMT.</p>
<p>    AMOUNT		MATURITY	  WEIGHTED AVERAGE</p>
<p>    1.3 bln		 2 days		  19.85 percent</p>
<p>    1.035 bln	     1 day		    N.A.</p>
<p>Figures in pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Elena Vega, mexico City newsroom +525 7289554))</p>
